# S-173 fixture, first launch (tooling/drive <profile> 10-setup.steps <pages a to f>).
# The profile was seeded by seed-profile.py: Spaces Home, Work and Play. The six pages
# open in Home. This run files them through the product's own keys:
#   Home: Page A, a folder holding Page B, Page C, Page D;  Work: Page E;  Play: Page F.
# Every coordinate is in window points of the 1400 x 880 window tooling/drive opens.
# Coordinates marked GUESS come from the layout of earlier captures (rows from y = 143,
# 46 points apart, under the Space title row; the rail's rows from y = 168, 50 apart)
# and are confirmed from setup-02-open.png and setup-03-rail.png before the other files run.
activate
wait 3
shot @SHOTS@/setup-00-start.png
# Page B into a new folder: Cmd-2 takes the second row, the bar's actions mode runs
# Move to New Folder on it.
key 2+cmd
wait 1
key p+cmd+shift
wait 1
type new folder
wait 1.5
shot @SHOTS@/setup-01-actions.png
key enter
wait 1.5
# Page E to Work: Cmd-5 (A 1, B 2 inside the folder, C 3, D 4, E 5, F 6), then the
# key that moves the tab to the next Space; the window follows it.
key 5+cmd
wait 1
key right+cmd+alt+shift
wait 2
# Back to Home; Page F is now Cmd-5. Two moves: to Work, then on to Play.
key 1+ctrl
wait 2
key 5+cmd
wait 1
key right+cmd+alt+shift
wait 2
key right+cmd+alt+shift
wait 2
key 1+ctrl
wait 2
key 1+cmd
wait 1
shot @SHOTS@/setup-02-open.png
# The rail, for its coordinates.
click 102 14
wait 2
hover 700 500
wait 2.5
shot @SHOTS@/setup-03-rail.png
click 42 50
wait 2
hover 700 500
wait 1
shot @SHOTS@/setup-04-open-again.png
